From: yihou <yihou@amd.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:22:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 14/31] [AMD] dsa: Add a page-split DSA decode top-k for DCP
 over a replicated index K

Each DCP rank scores every W-th context page, keeps a local top-k and
merges the all-gathered (score, position) candidates into the exact
global top-k. Unit tests check the merge against a single-rank top-k
with random scores, ties, partial pages and MTP verify rows.

